Source common.tape
Output compact_tree.gif
Env SCENE_FILE "Samples/prime_tactic.lean:8"
Source open.tape

Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type "[" Sleep 2s
Ctrl+B Left Sleep 500ms
Type ":11" Enter Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " k" Sleep 1s Escape Sleep 1500ms
Type ":16" Enter Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " k" Sleep 1s Escape Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type@400ms "jjk"
Sleep 3s
